{"server":"cn","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-15_end","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-15","title":"冬逝","storyCode":"6-17","avgTag":"行动后","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-15_end.txt","sourceHash":"a0225ef7ae64b8382b4b7b0acda837ad0da30f3c71bad8da7152dd63166a45f0","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"霜星永远地闭上了双眼。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第三关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_9"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_undergroud_f"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"碎了......吗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"老爷子从某个巫师那里求得这样东西......说是能维持住我的性命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"连一场战斗都没撑过去，呵呵，终归，还是假货。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"也许就像我们父女一样......？和现在的，荒诞的整合运动......也一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"唔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"咳，咳......煌！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"寒流已经......消散了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事！阿米娅，快，去看看那只白兔子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"赢得漂亮，罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我的兄弟姐妹们......我让他们白白死去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我们什么都没做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我的生命......一点价值都没有。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"他们是因为你的理念而追随你的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"煌","speakerId":"char_017_homura","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我的死......不值得任何人久留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"去救你们还能救的人吧。赶快。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"快去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"无论是阻止那些穿雨衣的，还是去追杀梅菲斯特，还是收容那些无处可去的感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"去吧。去做有价值的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士......"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我留下。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你去吧。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"博士，请告诉霜星小姐那句话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿米娅","speakerId":"char_002_amiya","isRemote":false,"text":"......拜托你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_10"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"真是只......天真的兔子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"很像啊。和当时的塔露拉，很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"在死前能看到这样的人，这样坚定地去实现理想的人......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"说好的责任呢？！","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"不是答应说要加入罗德岛的吗？","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"凭你的头脑，应该也考虑到这点了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"坏人也要有坏人该有的样子。我对自己应得的结局毫无怨言。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我伤害了你们，我和整合运动把目标对准了无辜的龙门人，一手促成了乌萨斯感染者的黑暗未来，这样的人根本没资格去罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我的兄弟姐妹......这些傻子，一定是想着让我活着吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"本以为哪怕这一次我死去了，这些傻子也能因此得到个允许他们活下去的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"没有，并没有。他们死了。为了保护我这个本来就没多少时间的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我不甘心。我们的性命全都被人利用了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我不甘心......这最后一刻的生命，这一点不属于我，这是他们所有人用血去换来的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"这一点点生命.......我必须交给值得信任的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":".......啊......即使活下来了，又有哪里可去呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我们本就没有其它地方可去。我们熟悉的从来就只有那片雪原而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门并不是乌萨斯。渴望着拯救同胞和感染者，想要去找一处又温暖，又有粮食，还有住处的地方......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"不该是龙门。自一开始，就不该是龙门。龙门的市民也在苦苦寻求自己的生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我们唯一该回去的，就只有乌萨斯......我们的祖国......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"雪......静静的河水......摇曳的松林......碧绿的苔衣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"这片大地，多么美好啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"所以，你认为塔露拉是操纵了这一切的人。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......如果我猜的没错......阴谋已经蓄势待发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"就算博卓卡斯替老爷子能拖上一时，塔露拉既然敢这样谋划，就一定有对付他的办法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"龙门没有出手的机会......而乌萨斯也会袖手旁观。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"但你们还在，感染者还有机会。哪怕只有一点点——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"——去毁掉现在的塔露拉。中止她的疯狂，不要让整合运动再吞噬更多感染者了。整合运动不需要塔露拉，任何一个塔露拉都不需要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"或者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......我的一点点私心。去拯救她。不。去帮助她。和我们那无数的感染者同胞一起......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"那个真正的......走在泥泞土地上的......塔露拉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"霜星小姐？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"你......说。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"我认为你父亲是真的爱你的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"就像你记得你的亲生父母为你而死。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你清楚地记着你父亲为你所做的一切。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我又怎么会不知道呢？只是，我要死在他之前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"如果他从来没捡到我，那会有多好。那样，他就不会因我感到痛苦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"他已经受了那么多的苦......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"正因为他受过很多苦，所以他才珍惜你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"呵呵......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......博士。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我可以这么叫你吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"罗德岛的博士。在这片大地上，选择也许没有意义。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"即使这样，即使结果没有区别......我也想自己去选。我做出选择了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"用我自己的手......去擦拭我结出的果。"},{"type":"narration","text":"霜星的手指摸索着你的面庞。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......你的手指，是暖的？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"奇怪。你的脸......很冰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我的体温......没有那么低了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"是。你的病征消失了。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"......","value":"2","blocks":[]},{"label":"很温暖，霜星。","value":"3","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......在死前......我终于又和人相碰了。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"霜星，阿米娅和我都希望你加入罗德岛。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"我真有这种资格？"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"仅仅是普通地死去，就没有时间再去改正错误。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"......不给出答复是不礼貌的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"告诉阿米娅，Dr.{@nickname}......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","isRemote":false,"text":"在这片大地上，仅凭一个人，是什么也做不到的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"avg_6_10_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但她绝对不是一个人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"现在开始，我在你身边。我在你们身边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......愿意加入罗德岛。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"谢谢你。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不。是我......谢谢你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的眼神......和我一位旧识，很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我遇见过一个男孩，他说他的哥哥宁愿上绞架也不愿改变观点去迎合敌人的宽恕......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以他要走过雪原，他要踏遍乌萨斯.......所以他没有和我们一起走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我以为那已经是我见过最理想化的人了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只是，你和阿米娅让我觉得……也许理想也可以成为一种信念。"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"罗德岛就是为了共同的信念而战的。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原本整合运动......也是一样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真像啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你的眼神，和那个孩子，真的很像。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"只不过，你没他那么坚定，但却比他......温柔太多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"放手吧。兄弟姐妹们在等我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......父亲......我真是个傻子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"原谅我吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"narration","text":"她滑落下去。\n她的嘴角上扬，高傲得像是依然还活着一般。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_002_amiya","aliases":["阿米娅"]},{"speakerId":"char_017_homura","aliases":["煌"]},{"speakerId":"char_1505_frstar","aliases":["霜星"]}]}
